":"en","tipo":"poema","titulo":"The Raven","autor":"Edgar Allan Poe","biblioteca":"/biblioteca/edgar-allan-poe/the-raven/","obra":"edgar-allan-poe/the-raven","parte":18,"trecho":"And the raven, never flitting, still…"},{"id":"edgar-allan-poe/the-raven-parte-2","idioma":"en","tipo":"poema","titulo":"The Raven","autor":"Edgar Allan Poe","biblioteca":"/biblioteca/edgar-allan-poe/the-raven/","obra":"edgar-allan-poe/the-raven","parte":2,"trecho":"Ah, distinctly I remember it was…"},{"id":"edgar-allan-poe/the-raven-parte-3","idioma":"en","tipo":"poema","titulo":"The Raven","autor":"Edgar Allan Poe","biblioteca":"/biblioteca/edgar-allan-poe/the-raven/","obra":"edgar-allan-poe/the-raven","parte":3,"trecho":"And the silken sad uncertain rustling…"},{"id":"edgar-allan-poe/the-raven-parte-4","idioma":"en","tipo":"poema","titulo":"The Raven","autor":"Edgar Allan Poe","biblioteca":"/biblioteca/edgar-allan-poe/the-raven/","obra":"edgar-allan-poe/the-raven","parte":4,"trecho":"Presently my soul grew stronger; hesitating…"},{"id":"edgar-allan-poe/the-raven-parte-5","idioma":"en","tipo":"poema","titulo":"The Raven","autor":"Edgar Allan Poe","biblioteca":"/biblioteca/edgar-allan-poe/the-raven/","obra":"edgar-allan-poe/the-raven","parte":5,"trecho":"Deep into that darkness peering, long…"},{"id":"edgar-allan-poe/the-raven-parte-6","idioma":"en","tipo":"poema","titulo":"The Raven","autor":"Edgar Allan Poe","biblioteca":"/biblioteca/edgar-allan-poe/the-raven/","obra":"edgar-allan-poe/the-raven","parte":6,"trecho":"Back into the chamber turning, all…"},{"id":"edgar-allan-poe/the-raven-parte-7","idioma":"en","tipo":"poema","titulo":"The Raven","autor":"Edgar Allan Poe","biblioteca":"/biblioteca/edgar-allan-poe/the-raven/","obra":"edgar-allan-poe/the-raven","parte":7,"trecho":"Open here I flung the shutter…"},{"id":"edgar-allan-poe/the-raven-parte-8","idioma":"en","tipo":"poema","titulo":"The Raven","autor":"Edgar Allan Poe","biblioteca":"/biblioteca/edgar-allan-poe/the-raven/","obra":"edg